# Copy to `.dev.vars` for `wrangler dev`. NEVER commit .dev.vars.
#
# Plumbing test with no real key and no OpenAI spend. The mock walks the same
# two-phase shape as the real model (ask for SQL, then answer), so the page's
# loop, SQL guard and table rendering can all be tested offline:
CHAT_MOCK="1"
#
# Real local test (calls OpenAI, costs money): comment out CHAT_MOCK above and
# set your key here instead:
# OPENAI_API_KEY="sk-...your key..."
